+# Task11 covering report
+
+Status: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS — source and owned isolated proof complete; final three compositions and four qualified local gates GREEN. Controller independent review and fresh five exact-head/fullPG17.11 CI remain pending. ProductionApplied/deployed/operationallyEnabled all false.
+
+## Identity, scope and authority
+
